                        "sense_id": "36485491-1aba-3139-9262-c9bc4783fe1c",
                        "entry_id": "74bf635a-da06-381a-9925-1338a79656ca",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n'a pas de conducteur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ad4f6c2-6c72-472c-9be6-84f438149c1e",
                                "sense_id": "36485491-1aba-3139-9262-c9bc4783fe1c",
                                "text": "While Zoox and other companies have started to reveal how humans intervene to help driverless cars, none of the companies have disclosed how many remote-assistance technicians they employ or how much it all costs.",
                                "translation": "Quand Zoox et d'autres sociétés révèlent le moyen humain d'intervention aidant les voitures sans conducteur, aucune société n'a communiqué ni le nombre de télé-techniciens employés, ni leurs couts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02cc2e9a-2df7-44c6-9be3-fdff1dcf3635",
                                "sense_id": "36485491-1aba-3139-9262-c9bc4783fe1c",
                                "text": "On September 11, 2024, East Japan Railway announced it would launch self-driving trains by 2028. Japan Times said its driverless locomotive will make operations more efficient and sustainable. JR East explained it will install autonomous trains for the Joetsu Shinkansen line between the Tokyo and Niigata stations."
                            }
                        ]
